    "text": "By Meredith Yeomans ,\n1 hours ago It's official. Dallas is getting its first H-E-B. Despite some opposition, the supermarket chain cleared a major hurdle on Wednesday at a Dallas city council meeting. “Today, we are extremely excited about the opportunity to finally bring our namesake brand to the City of Dallas,” said Benjamin Scott, Group Vice President of Real Estate and Shopping Center Development for H-E-B. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
